        "sid": "GEN 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etoigo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene agateebia Nuhu: “Soa ase obwato ime amo nabaanto bao, ekiagera buna nakorigereirie, narorire ng’a ase ekegori eke naye bweka ore omonyaboronge ase obosio bwaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ogosoa, oirane amo naye ching’iti chichenegete, isano na ibere isano na ibere, chinsacha ne chinkuungu; na ase kera eng’iti etachenegeti, ibere ibere, ensacha na enkuungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende oirane ne chinyoni chikoiruruka, isano na ibere isano na ibere, chinsacha ne chinkuungu. Okore ayio ase engencho y’okorenda kera egesaku erio kegenderere koba moyo ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’amatuko atano na abere nindete embura ase ense etwe amatuko emerongo ene, omobaso na obotuko, na kende gionsi nakorete kere moyo ase ense ningesirie kegima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Nuhu agakora ayio onsi buna Omonene amochiigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuhu konya okorire emiaka amagana atano na rimo (600) engaki eyio etoigo yachete ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuhu agasoa ase obwato ime amo nabana baye abamura, na mokaye, na baka bamura baye, ase ogwetooria korwa ase etoigo eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ase ching’iti chichenegete, ne ching’iti chitachenegeti, ne chinyoni na ebitongwa bionsi ebikwagura igoro ase ense,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chigasoa ase obwato amo na Nuhu ibere ibere, chinsacha ne chinkuungu, buna Nyasae achiigete Nuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio magega y’amatuko atano na abere, etoigo egacha ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka oria ekero konya Nuhu aikire emiaka amagana atano na rimo (600), ase rituko ria ikomi, na gatano na kabere ri’omotienyi o kabere, chinsoko chionsi chi’amaache chikabera ne chinguru korwa inse, na ebibao bia igoro bikaigoka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na embura egatwa igoro ase ense, rioka rioka ase amatuko emerongo ene, omobaso na obotuko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko erio erio Nuhu agasoa ase obwato ime amo na Shemu, na Hamu, na Yafeti, bamura baye, na mokaye, na baka bamura baye batato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nabarabwo, chigasoa ching’iti chi’orosana echia kera egesaku, ne ching’iti chigotugwa echia kera egesaku, na echikwagura echia kera egesaku, na kera enyoni y’egesaku kende gionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na chirochio chionsi echiare moyo chigasoa ibere ibere ase obwato amo na Nuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ching’iti ne chinyoni chionsi chiasoete, chinsacha ne chinkuungu chire moyo chia kera egesaku, chigasoa buna Nyasae achiigete Nuhu, eri’Omonene akamosiekera egesieri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etoigo eria ekagenderera igoro y’ense ase engaki y’amatuko emerongo ene, ekagera amaache akamentekana mono, erio agacheng’enenia obwato na koboimokereria igoro mono kegima korwa ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amache aria akaba nechinguru, na akamenteka mono igoro y’ense, na obwato boria bogacheng’enena ase amaache ayio igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amache ayio akagenderera komenteka mono na akaba nechinguru chinene, erio agoichora igoro ase ense goika ebitunwa bionsi ebitambe mono kegima, biareenge kera ase inse y’erioba, bikarimera amaache ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amache ayio akamenteka rioka rioka agoichora, agatiira goika ebirengo bi’amaboko ikomi na atano igoro y’ebitunwa bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ching’iti chiria ne chinyoni chionsi echiare moyo, chiare gotaara ase ense, chigakwa; chinyoni, ne ching’iti chiatugire, ne ching’iti chi’orosana, na echikwagura, amo na Mwanyabaanto bonsi bagakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebitongire bionsi biare koeyanera chimioro na bire moyo, na bionsi ebiareenge ase ense enyomo bigakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae agasiria ebinto bionsi biare moyo, ebiareenge igoro ase ense, Mwanyabaanto ne ching’iti chigotaara na amoogoro, na echikwagura, ne chinyoni chia igoro; na bionsi bigasirigwa korwa ase ense engima; Korende Nuhu bweka agatoorigwa amo nabwo baareenge amo nere ase obwato ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amache ayio akagenderera koyaaba igoro ase ense, ase engaki y’amatuko rigana erimo, na emerongo etano (150).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
